# INVLPG—Invalidate TLB Entries -- override
# 'Invalidate(RelevantTLBEntries);' for the page holding the operand's
# linear address (v1: the effective address; segment bases are 0 or FS/GS
# in practice); #GP(0) at CPL > 0. The TLB drops every entry that could
# map it.
@operation
IF CPL > 0 THEN #GP(0); FI;
TlbInvalidate(2, EffectiveAddress(SRC));
